<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AQC says Marsford now offers 78c/shr.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AQC says Marsford now offers 78c/shr.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Queensland Coal Ltd said on Wednesday that Marsford Investments Pte Ltd had raised its takeover bid to 78 cents per share from the previous offer of 70 cents per share.</p>
</text>
